    "notes": [
      "Full C# 7.3 compilation against 184 supplied game references passed. 1125 offline assertions passed, covering upstream parser and Community Patch 0.38.1 contracts, all optional-mod session states, entry bounds/gates, precise-arrival signs/slew/reset and pre-dive station flags. Unity objects and native Harmony dispatch remain fixtures; no CI build is claimed."
