  },
  "known_issues": [
    "Not run inside UBOAT; native patch dispatch, menu rendering, officer pathfinding and actual physics improvement remain unverified.",
    "Precise arrival covers only ordinary II/VII 2-10 m orders with shallow plane/trim handover enabled; Type II requires a seated officer. No exact arrival or steady hold is guaranteed.",
    "Pre-dive availability is shared with crew slots; it does not assign an officer automatically. Turning it off restores normal restrictions.",
    "Entry leveling, prolonged PD cycling and surfacing power interruption remain open. Historical test-dive arrival overshoot alone is not automatically a defect."
  ],
